 "notes": "German value catalogue brand. The bonprix UK women's guide lists order sizes 6–32 with chest, waist and hip ranges in cm; it does not label them UK, EU or US. Between two sizes, bonprix says to order the larger. Popular secondhand for affordable basics and occasion wear in extended sizes.",
 "audit": "Old /service/size-guide/ gives a server error; footer link goes to /web/main/size_guide.asp. Women's Sizes table, order sizes 6-32, cm ranges (printed chest stored as bust). Old rows used EU-style labels 32/XS-52/2XL and were far off: 40/M uk 12 91/73/98 vs order size 12 86-89/70-73/96-98; 48/XL uk 20 109/91/116 vs order size 20 103-107/87-91/111-115. UK/US/EU removed: chart prints only 'Order Size'. Inch figures on the page not stored.",
